# Crew and relationship beats, trait reactions, and inactive-friendly events.
# House style: content/STYLE.md.

# The Starbase stash: opened on a fixed day so the Sharpie hand is known by arrival.
card l_stash
type event
cat human
due
once
days 10 10
roles A
when cond A ok
when home A
text Behind a stowage panel on {A}'s ship, three ration packs that never made the manifest. Someone at Starbase wrote "you'll thank me" on the bag in Sharpie, next to a little drawing of a Starship with its fingers crossed.
do open dil_stash

card dil_stash
type dilemma
once
cat human
days 10 10
weight 1
duration 3
roles A
when !fired dil_stash
lean warm share keep
text The three packs from behind the panel are the good rations, the ones the galley ran out of first. They aren't on any inventory.
option keep | Keep them quiet | {A} thanks the packer silently. The packs go into a personal locker, for the bad week every mission eventually has.
  set stash_kept
  mark t_stash
  who stash_who A
  morale A 6
option share | Hand them in | {A} turns them in, bag and all. The galley has an unplanned surplus for the first time since launch.
  who stash_who A
  res food 3
  morale A 2

card stash_found
type beat
cat human
due
once
days 23 31
roles A B
when flag stash_kept
when since t_stash >= 10
when is A stash_who
text {A} opens the locker before breakfast, tags one pack for {B} for the next crossing window, and eats another on video with {B}, reading the bag aloud like the back of a cereal box.
do bond A B 6
do morale A 3
do set stash_exposed
do who stash_b B

card beat_watch
type beat
cat wonder
once
days 8 11
weight 10
roles A B
when bond A B >= -20
text {A} and {B} stand the night watch over the fleet link, each in a dark cabin. Earth is a thin bright crescent now, low beside the Sun's glare, already smaller than the Moon looks from home. They make coffee at the same minute, as if that counted.
do bond A B 6

# Trait-driven reaction: what happens depends on how brave A is.
card glint
type event
cat wonder
days 11 30
weight 8
once
roles A
when trait A curious >= -5
when cond A ok
lean brave closer window
text {A} spots a glint keeping pace off the starboard side, catching the sun every few seconds.
option closer | Get a closer look | {A} talks Mission Control into a camera slew: a flake of ice from the last waste-water dump, tumbling, a little smaller every hour.
  trait A brave 3
option window | Track it from the window | {A} notes its bearing hourly: ice from the last waste-water dump, tumbling, smaller each hour.
  trait A curious 2

